        <mxCell id="gh-project-repos__port_left_2240_580" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;TCP 443&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=6;html=1;fillColor=#64748b;strokeColor=#f8fafc;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=9;fontColor=#ffffff;movable=0;resizable=0;" vertex="1" parent="gh-project-repos">
          <mxGeometry x="-22.90000000000009" y="42" width="45.8" height="16" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n-401" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;No or revoked token: /mcp answers 401 with resource_metadata, the assistant starts the OAuth connection.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=10;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="730" width="340" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n-policy" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;Before acting, the tool reads the project&amp;#39;s stake: allow, ask the user, open a PR, wait for an approval in the CMP, or refuse.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=10;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="850" width="340" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-steps" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#059669&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Request path · a tool call that changes an app&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; The assistant calls a tool, e.g. push_files, with its CMP token (opaque, 15 min, user&amp;#39;s Keycloak sub).&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; Cloudflare relays it through the platform tunnel.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; cloudflared forwards cmp.3istor.com to Envoy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt; HTTPRoute cmp-mcp sends /mcp to the backend, without the Keycloak JWT policy: the backend checks its own tokens.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt; After the stake policy, the tool calls the CMP REST API in-process with the same token: RBAC, validation and the audit journal (via = assistant) apply.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;6&lt;/span&gt; Code and release tags go to the app repository through the GitHub App, in one commit, or in a pull request on a critical project.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1330" width="1220" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-background" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d97706&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Background · control plane&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt; The MCP server reads the guides from cnp-agent-kit every 10 minutes and serves them as skill:// resources and get_guide.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt; On a vX.Y.Z tag, the app&amp;#39;s CI pushes the image to GHCR.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt; Image Updater writes the new tag back to the app repository.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;D&lt;/span&gt; Argo CD polls the app values.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt; Argo CD applies them; a canary runs when the app has one.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1300" y="1330" width="1220" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-other" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0284c7&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Other connections drawn&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• Claude Code, Codex, Cursor and VS Code take the same path as &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• Envoy → OAuth server: /authorize, /token, /register, /revoke and /.well-known/oauth-*, see the agent-connect sequence.&lt;br&gt;• Envoy → CMP frontend: the consent page /connect/authorize and the approval page /connect/confirm/&amp;lt;id&amp;gt;.&lt;br&gt;• Envoy → CMP backend: /api for the web UI; it keeps the Keycloak JWT SecurityPolicy.&lt;br&gt;• Envoy → Keycloak: the usual OIDC login of the CMP, which the consent page relies on.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1580" width="1220" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-gaps" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ea580c&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Gaps between docs and code&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;G3&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Transport.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; TLS ends at Cloudflare. In-cluster hops are plain HTTP.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;G4&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Coupling.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Tunnels target Envoy&amp;#39;s hashed Service. Covered by D-05.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;G6&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Token call.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; The CMP&amp;#39;s OIDC token call likely hairpins via Cloudflare. To verify.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;G7&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;CMP API auth.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Since this view was first drawn, the backend verifies signature, issuer and expiry, and cmp-api-jwt checks JWTs at the edge. Audience is still not checked. /mcp uses the CMP&amp;#39;s own tokens, checked by the backend.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1810" width="1220" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-legend" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Legend&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
